{
  "name": "Site to RAG chunks (QuanticData)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Site to RAG chunks (JSONL)\nDiscovers a site's URLs with the map endpoint (sitemaps and homepage links), scrapes them in one batch job, splits each page's Markdown at its headings and returns a `chunks.jsonl` file (one chunk per line with url, title and heading) for a vector store.\n\n## Setup\n1. Create an API key on the QuanticData dashboard (API keys page).\n2. In n8n: Credentials > New > **Header Auth**. Name: `QuanticData API`, header name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_KEY`.\n3. Open each orange HTTP Request node and pick that credential.\n4. Edit **Settings**: the site, an optional URL filter and a page limit. Start small.\n\nBilled per map call and per scraped page: https://quanticdata.io/pricing/",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 5
      },
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -160,
        -420
      ],
      "id": "cfbfd99a-ea95-4140-a0e6-8b8a6c3202ee"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "name": "Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
